# @hub-lanes

# ── GITHUB APP QUOTA SUSTAINED ALERT ────────────────────────────────────────
# Hourly at :19 (after gh-ledger-push has landed the previous hour from every
# box, and after gh-pat-charge-alert at :17): read the fleet gh_ledger for the
# last GH_QUOTA_ALERT_HOURS complete UTC hours and write ONE logs/ALERTS.log
# line per UTC day when an App bucket's counted requests stayed at or above
# GH_QUOTA_ALERT_PCT of its limit in every one of them. Zero GitHub calls.
# Off via GH_QUOTA_ALERT=0 or flags/lane-off-gh-quota-sustained-alert.
19 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/gh-quota-sustained-alert.sh hub >/dev/null 2>&1
